                            <li>• Create a new corporate entity</li>
                            <li>• Convert both source ROOTs to AGGREGATION</li>
                            <li>• Update all VA corporate_ids</li>
                            <li>• Recalculate all balance aggregations</li>
                          </ul>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

